{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4a238306-f8cd-8526-86cb-331dcc3655a7",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T13:08:02-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Joao Moniz",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:06:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:06:55-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. I got an old dryer in the garage. Dead. Need to know how I get rid of it. Does the regular trash truck take it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:07:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not with the regular pickup, no. Appliances like a dryer are handled separately. Is it just the one dryer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:07:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the one. Been sitting there since the fall. I was gonna deal with it last weekend but then that snow and rain came through Sunday into Monday, so, that's the way it goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:07:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. So you'd want a special pickup for one dryer. I'll put that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:07:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is there a fee? Because nobody told me there'd be a fee for hauling it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:07:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There can be a charge for appliances, yes. I don't have the exact amount in front of me, so let me transfer you to the person who schedules those and they can tell you the cost and the date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:07:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Hold on, let me move, I'm at my desk here. I'm putting a stamp collection on a spreadsheet, took me all morning, so I'd like to get back to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:07:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so that's a dryer, one unit, you're a homeowner. Stay on the line, Mr. Moniz, I'll connect you now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:08:00-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Thanks."
    }
  ],
